From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 07:44:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 041/155] [ae-patch] Give tooltips the popover surface in light
 mode too

In light mode every tooltip was a near-black box with white text, which
Reid read as a dark-mode bug on an otherwise light page (2026-10-14). The
shared TooltipContent now takes the popover surface in both themes
(bg-popover, text-popover-foreground, shadow-menu and a faint ring), the
style the skill pills' tooltip already chose. Dark mode looks as before.

The context ring's tooltip dimmed its second line with text-neutral-400
for the dark box; it now uses text-muted-foreground, and its test follows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
